# S08-T05: `apps/work-control/planning/` Scaffold

## Objective

First in-repo instance directory — no app code, planning artifacts only.

## App-agent preflight (MANDATORY)

- [ ] `explain("in-repo-planning")` + `explain("organization-planning")`
- [ ] `list-apps` — confirm work-control exists

## Implementation

- [ ] Create `apps/work-control/planning/`:
  - `INSTANCE.md` — hub, links to org handbook
  - `BRIEF.md` — work-control as orchestrator (stub)
  - `PROTOCOL.md` — pointer to `docs/content/2.company/totem-governance.md` + per-app orchestrator.md
  - `templates/PD-BLOCK.md` — copy from totem or embedded fallback
  - `sprints/.gitkeep`
- [ ] **Do not** create `apps/todo/`

## Done when

- [ ] Directory matches S08-INVARIANTS contract
- [ ] `get-file` via MCP resolves INSTANCE.md
